    "text": "Given <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><mo>&rArr;</mo><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math><math><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Hence, the least positive integer value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>.",
